"               Máy không tự suy điều đó."
msgstr ""
"Whether a category is equipment or a component is <b>your own decision</b>:\n"
"               open <i>Configuration ▸ Component categories</i> and tick <b>“Is equipment”</b>.\n"
"               The system does not infer it."

